Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with these eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't the vaguest idea what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's painfully clear that\Nit's no longer Pale Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel terrible. Something is quickly\Nraging out of control inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,there's some kind of independent power\Nthat's ignoring my will but oddly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,i feel hope in this power hope in\Nfact is the one and only thing i feel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,from it dio's note recorded in\Njotro's memories perhaps that is what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,i need to control this power then\Nthe time and place north latitude 28
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:01:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,degrees 24 minutes west longitude 80\Ndegrees 36 minutes delightful heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,appears to be there after all and\Nthat place is at cape canaveral space
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.42,0:01:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,center to be precise at the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.62,0:01:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,of everything there was gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even this round earth of ours was\Nbrought into reality with gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.26,0:01:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna keep falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not falling down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're falling backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the Priest's new ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you grab hold of Emporia!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tybar, drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And with its gravitational pull, the\Nearth continues to revolve around the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The question that still remains\Nis where on earth am I headed now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going to happen next?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.96,0:02:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew my old man sealed away some\Nsort of ability in Egypt 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the heaven the\Npriest has been searching for!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Within my body and spirit\Nlies the existence of gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.58,0:02:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And it shall also exist\Nat the end of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's our way into the visitor center.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, are you sure the priest\Nis still in this direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's close, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense him right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It almost feels like he was\Njust standing in this spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the priest's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it in a new form?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Destiny is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm afraid of all my\Nfuture? As long as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.84,0:02:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar's red and white.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:03:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go over the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to eliminate you for good,\Nsince you couldn't wait two more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My arms turning inside out! Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.10,0:04:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.26,0:04:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the friend who was\Naiding Jolene in prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and run to where Anastasia is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's circled behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,First order of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dispels of Jolene Cujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, hurry up and come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like your hair turned\Nin on itself, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And so did my cleats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be his attacks like from when his\Nfist grazed us but it barely made contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So if he punches us\Nwe'll be in big trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,gravity judging by everything\Nthat's been Happening
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,around us this probably\Nhas to do with gravity too
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,jolene whether it be an\Napple or the Planet itself
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,everything on earth is\Naffected by gravity and all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,of it is pulled towards\Nthe earth's Gravitational
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,center that's the natural\Nlaw of the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,except this guy's Ability\Nmesses with that it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:05:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,makes the gravity go in\Nthe opposite direction
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why whenever his\Nstance fists make contact
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,with something it'll be\NInverted and I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,how far but with everything\Nsideways we're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep falling so this is\Nit thanks to the unique
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,energy around cape canaveral\Nthe Priest has somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,developed a new stand\Nit's no longer pale snake
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,which to have the ability\Nto manipulate memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor does it have the ability to split itself\Nin half infinitely like the green baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming back around!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to jump toward Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Emporia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.06,0:06:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, she did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's inverting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to get so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get turned inside\Nout every time he hits me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,then that just means I'll\Nhave to let him hit me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so i can flip myself back to normal\Nso he can invert me all he wants to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,because i'll just hit\Nhim with the reverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.34,0:07:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,oh good freaking grief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it does the job but i still have to\Nsew my wounds back up with my thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,although thanks to that there's\None thing i'm sure of Lucky for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as we can hit\Nhim, he'll take damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's looking like I should finish\Nthis guy off right here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be babysitting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:07:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Emporio, start climbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your way up to that handrail!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to make sure my darling\NJolene is back up if she needs it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Polna, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.77,0:08:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This ticket box you're clinging on to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,has already been turned inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with his movements?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:09:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by its power, I thought it\Nwould be an automated pursuit stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.74,0:09:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but his attacks are way too precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's not focused on attacking\Nmy arms or legs anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.62,0:09:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Like he knows it's useless, so he's\Nonly pinpointing my vital areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,like my face and chest knowing\Nthat if his fists touch me there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be fatal plus he dodged my\Nkick and managed to get out of the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,way by just millimeters which means\Nthis is a remote control stand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the priest has to be around here\Nwatching with his own eyes in other
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,words his stands movements are so\Naccurate because he's watching every?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's stand causes destruction\Nby manipulating gravity,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so it just seems like he's powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Poochie would be hiding far\Naway, but I get the sense that he's a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,lot closer than I realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's somewhere close by with\Na clear view of the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyperdrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you I'm\Nhere to dispose of Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.15,0:10:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone oceans!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.67,0:10:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell, Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet if you tried, you could probably jump\Nonto the tiles on the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But for right now, don't\Nlet go of that rope, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,With your weight tightening the\Nrope, his stance being held down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and getting the life choked out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And he doesn't have the\Npower to fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's completely defenseless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No freaking way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stan's desperately trying\Nto grab onto Jolene's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,rope with his hands before\Nit gets choked to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If this thing manages to get a hold of\Nthose threads of yours with its hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.43,0:10:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the rope's gonna get\Ninverted and break away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:11:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that rope off of his\Nneck, Jolene! Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This was a distraction!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it so you could get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm running\Naway from this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With this rope around its neck, we\Nfinally have a chance to end him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And for the record, I'm not\Nactually trying to choke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to get closer so\NI can pummel it into the pavement!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you saying, Jolene?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If he lays even a finger\Non your thick rope
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and ends up inverting\Neverything attached to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,that means your entire arm is gonna be\Nturned inside out and blown into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to climb over\Nthere right now to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene isn't the type of person to\Ngive up, even if we tell her to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And this situation is\Ncrazy. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to go, then do it quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get your foot out of\Nthat metal frame before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we've grabbed the rope already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:11:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.10,0:12:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My thread can still hold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't cut it until I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Sigma Team reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't advance any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our vehicles have been flipped over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All our attempts to\Nhead towards the visitor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,center have resulted in\Nour trucks being flipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, flipped over?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.94,0:12:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They got flipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Some sort of force is\Nturning over our vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea why, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to need a scholar or\Na specialist to make sense of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rescuing the survivors is our duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but sir, we really\Ndon't know what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The extent of damage done and the number\Nof casualties or survivors are all unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Debris is scattered everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:12:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:13:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if a massive hammer came down from\Nthe sky and smashed everything to shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.54,0:13:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This road's been turned into a junkyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Jayhawk 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about three kilometers away from\Nthe visitor's center and have eyes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving in to\Nlocate any survivors now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way is up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayday! Mayday!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.10,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,J-Hawk Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,J-Hawk Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Report your status!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,J-Hawk Six, respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She does have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This situation is our chance\Nto defeat the Priest's Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much of a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene's arm is getting closer and\Ncloser to crumbling in the pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to make\Nyour way to him, then hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your shot and kill\Nthis bastard already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to turn the frame inside out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If he manages to do that, he'll\Nlift himself back up and be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and ram his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already getting up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the stand has flipped\Nthe tiles over again, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.34,0:14:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he grabbed onto it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your throat off its neck right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, your arm\Nis gonna get torn apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive or try!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.48,0:14:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I went ahead and took the liberty of\Nphasing Diver Drive into the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of the thread being turned inside\Nout and Jolene suffering the consequences,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:15:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the responsibility of taking\Nthat affliction falls to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep going, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as your rope is tightly wrapped\Naround that son-of-a-bitch's throat,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make damn sure that its body\Ndoesn't get it for even a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish this guy off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I should have disposed\Nof you when I had the chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.98,0:15:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what it might have cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Back at the very beginning,\Nwhen we met in the prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ was\Nfated to be crucified on the cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as the Holy Mother Mary\Nwas fated to lose her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.82,0:15:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for human beings\Nto attain happiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,they must first overcome their destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And the obstacles Dio and I must overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you damned Joestars in your bloodline?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest himself was\Nhere the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason I have come is to save my stand\Nfrom you while it's still incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.66,0:16:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I lifting towards the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.54,0:16:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is the gravitational center.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,From where my feet are grounded,\Ngravity is pulled in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And the closer you get, the\Nstronger the pull becomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do now is wait\Nfor my stand to become complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As it is, my ability is still too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It must finish its evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, pull Jolene down with her rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely, my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to turn them inside\Nout, you must only hit
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.22,0:17:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,them one time, I'll say it\Nagain: only hit them one
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,time don't waste time\Ntargeting places like her
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,arms or legs only deal one\Npunch without exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll continue waiting\Nin the visitor center.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene can no longer feel any pain or have\Nthe ability to use cognitive functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Her heart has been turned inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood meant for her brain\Nshould also be flowing in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on pulling, Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull Jolene's body back down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene's thread's pulling apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It will need a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call this new ability Seamoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Invincibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the power I've obtained even\Nbefore the coming of the new moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:19:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I must keep on telling myself it\Nis not power which I desire. But rather,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,what I truly long for is\Nthe ultimate happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that every human being has\Nthe potential to achieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And Jolene Kujo was merely a\Nsacrificial pawn towards that end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The same goes for Weather\Nand the other prisoners who
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,valiantly gave their lives to\Nfurther my righteous objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.46,0:19:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Their sacrifice was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just isn't possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.14,0:19:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:19:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't working before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a text message.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But who was it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My calls aren't going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The gravitational anomaly seems to\Nhave sent a satellite out of orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Emporio?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.18,0:20:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know exactly what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can sense that my daughter\Nand the priest have met.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.82,0:20:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.73,0:20:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,could this text be from...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the person who said this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene is alive, but she's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.30,0:20:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just until I arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have discovered\Nhow to counter his gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way she\Ncould have survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.72,0:20:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's alive, but just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro He must be close by
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.95,0:20:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.68,0:21:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene's actually still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that means!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia you gotta find Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.82,0:21:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that Jolene is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,For real!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah but that also means that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That pooch he'd lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he has the same\Nability to sense her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.98,0:21:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's aware that she's still alive too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.00,0:21:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Her heart should have\Nbeen turned inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My gravitational power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have destroyed it completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How in the world is she still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Joestar bloodline is something I\Nmust overcome, no matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive or drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.72,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.32,0:22:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to protect Jolene, I'm gonna\Nhave to kill that fucking priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.88,0:22:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.66,0:22:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.10,0:23:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,about all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.24,0:23:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the things I'd like to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.44,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.52,0:23:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.64,0:23:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,a distant dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.94,0:23:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,dreaming far
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.32,0:23:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,away from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.74,0:23:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.50,0:24:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
